<section id="usecases" class="usecases" aria-labelledby="usecases-heading">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 id="usecases-heading">A Flexible Platform for Any Department</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">While built for IT, the core engine of CentraDesk request tracking, asset management, and a knowledge base. Can be configured to support any service department in your organization.</p>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Human Resources</h3>
                <p>Use the ticketing system to create a confidential portal for employee questions. Track physical assets like security badges and company phones assigned to staff.</p>
                <ul class="uses-list">
                    <li>Onboarding Requests</li>
                    <li>Policy Questions</li>
                    <li>Track Assigned Phones</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Facilities Management</h3>
                <p>Adapt the ticketing system for maintenance work orders. Use the asset management module to track valuable equipment and tools.</p>
                 <ul class="uses-list">
                    <li>Maintenance Work Orders</li>
                    <li>Office Supply Requests</li>
                    <li>Track Company Tools</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                     <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="8" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2"></rect><rect width="8" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2"></rect><rect width="8" height="8" x="14" y="2" rx="2"></rect><rect width="8" height="8" x="14" y="14" rx="2"></rect></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Operations Teams</h3>
                <p>A simple but powerful platform to manage internal team tasks, track project issues, or handle client feedback in a centralized list.</p>
                 <ul class="uses-list">
                    <li>Internal Task Assignments</li>
                    <li>Project Issue Tracking</li>
                    <li>Client Feedback Logs</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">
            <strong>Note:</strong> Using CentraDesk for other departments requires a one-time setup of new SharePoint lists and Power Automate flows, which can be done as a professional service. The core application is flexible enough to support these use cases.
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

